<title>POLAND: BRE TO ISSUE NFI UNIT WARRANTS.</title>
<headline>BRE TO ISSUE NFI UNIT WARRANTS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Rozwoju Exportu SA (BRE) will issue 350 American call warrants for 100 NFI units each to individual investors on Thursday, a BRE official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BRE analyst Dariusz Gatarek said the warrants, which will run until September 11, 1997, will be issued for different prices between 170 and 200 zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units traded at 166 zlotys in regular Warsaw bourse trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
